Two-phase training (fixed 768 + multi-scale), TTA, variable-row submission,
and visualization (original + pred mask + Grad-CAM concatenated JPEG).

Hard constraints:
- HADES environment (paths under /workspace)
- NO DDP
- FP32 only (NO AMP)
- One-file end-to-end: split -> train -> eval -> infer -> submission -> visualization
- Strict detector identity check by sha1(first1MB)

