- Train segmentation (union mask) + embedding head for instance separation.
- Avoid watershed (over-splitting) by using embedding + DBSCAN clustering within connected components.
- Recall-oriented loss: BCEWithLogits + Tversky(alpha,beta) (beta>alpha to penalize FN).
- Two-phase training:
  Phase1: fixed 768
  Phase2: multi-scale sizes list (e.g. 640/704/768/832/896)

Dependencies:
- Python >= 3.9
- torch, torchvision
- numpy, pillow
- opencv-python (cv2) OR scipy (fallback) for connected components/morphology
- scikit-learn for DBSCAN

